lass=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"feature-name\">LiDAR 포인트 클라우드 재구성</td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"feature-name\">지형 결과</td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"feature-name\">가우시안 스플래팅</td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"feature-name\">전력 사업 활용 [17]</td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"feature-name\">클러스터 연산</td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"cross\">─</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span></td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"check\">✔</span>